license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/cooking43/USV"
abstract: >-
  Dynamic knowledge-augmented vision-language reasoning for unmanned surface
  vehicle navigation in inland waterways. A fixed rule space encoding the
  Inland Rules and an expandable experience space admitted through a
  deterministic rule-consistency gate are retrieved into a compact prompt for a
  vision-language backbone, and the resulting command passes a short-horizon
  clearance check before execution.
